Incydr agents that had already established communication with the Incydr cloud prior to the outage were not affected. A subset of agents that established a connection during the outage may have experienced a monitoring gap of up to six hours. 

Mimecast Engineering teams identified the issue and worked to restore services. All Incydr services were verified to be functioning normally as of 01:30 UTC on March 24, 2026. 

Please reach out to your Mimecast representative with any questions.</description></item><item><title>Authentication Failures in Prod Gov [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/xvgny97wbn0x</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-03-19T21:50:49.753-05:00</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 02:50:49 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved all services are back and running.</description></item><item><title>Delay in Processing Cloud Detector Security Events [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/963rv21styss</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-03-10T18:27:54.358-05:00</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2026 23:27:54 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Delay in processing Alerts [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/4n4cm452xgrh</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-03-05T07:21:59.320-06:00</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Mar 2026 13:21:59 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Delay in processing Alerts [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/p3brvhltbdzr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-02-18T14:37:08.997-06:00</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Feb 2026 20:37:08 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Event Processing Delays [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/5zswglxg5wxl</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-02-04T15:16:07.252-06:00</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 21:16:07 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Event Processing Delays [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/h2w59wf2cns2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">code-42:2026-02-03T20:07:48.124-06:00</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 02:07:48 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item></channel></rss>